  "name": "Three Herb Sauce",
  "text": "Three Herb Sauce\n\nPreparation time: 10 minutes\n\nCooking time: 0 minutes\n\nYield: 4\n\nIngredients\n\n3 tbsp chopped parsley,\n\n1 tbsp chopped tarragon,\n\n2 tbsp chopped basil,\n\n1 tbsp olive oil,\n\n1 large garlic clove (crushed),\n\n4 tbsp chicken stock,\n\n2 tbsp dry white wine,\n\nsalt and pepper.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Put all of the ingredients into a food processor or blender and work until smooth, then add salt and pepper to taste.",
